<title>USA: Big Flower Press Holdings Inc Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Big Flower Press Holdings Inc Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.09     loss	 $0.35</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,681     loss	 6,315</p>
<p> Revs		     297,501		  229,128</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,327		   18,065</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 includes a charge of $1.9 million, or $0.11 a share, from early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>Company acquired Scanforms Inc in October 1996 for 1.6 million shares of stock.</p>
<p>Adjusted 1996 Q1 net loss $1.9 million, or $0.11 a share, excluding $5.0 million in charges for financing transactions in Webcraft and a $1.9 million charge in refinancing debt.</p>
